<https://w3id.org/alskg/schema/DrugActionDirectionEnum#degrades> a owl:NamedIndividual, alskg:DrugActionDirectionEnum ;
    rdfs:label "degrades" ;
    skos:definition "Drug promotes degradation of the target." .

<https://w3id.org/alskg/schema/DrugActionDirectionEnum#inhibits> a owl:NamedIndividual, alskg:DrugActionDirectionEnum ;
